    ('<h3>手机和平板</h3>', '<h3>Phones and tablets</h3>'),
    ('<li>油门自动踩住。屏幕下方 ◀ ▶ 转向，「漂移」按住蓄力，「刹车」刹车/倒车，「道具」使用道具。</li><li>双人对战需要键盘，手机上不能选。</li>',
     '<li>Gas is automatic. Use ◀ ▶ at the bottom to steer, hold DRIFT to charge a boost, BRAKE to brake or reverse, and ITEM to use your item.</li><li>2-player mode needs a keyboard, so it is not available on phones.</li>'),
    ('<h3>小技巧</h3>', '<h3>Tips</h3>'),
    ('<li>火箭起步：倒数的「2」出现后马上按住油门（手柄 A），到 GO 时冲出去。按得太早（「3」还在时就按）会起步失败。开着自动加速也要自己按。</li>',
     '<li>Rocket start: hold gas right after “2” appears in the countdown and you will shoot off at GO. Press too early (while “3” is showing) and you stall. You need to press it even with auto-accelerate on.</li>'),
    ('<li>加速带：压过地上的箭头会加速；跳台上腾空时按漂移键做特技，落地加速。</li>', '<li>Boost pads: drive over the arrows for a burst of speed. Press drift in the air off a ramp to do a trick and boost on landing.</li>'),
    ('<li>吸尾流：紧跟在别人车后一会儿，会有风线并自动加速。</li>', '<li>Slipstream: stay right behind another kart for a moment and you get a speed boost.</li>'),
    ('<li>道具箱：撞碎后很快会重新出现；道具转盘转动时按道具键能让它马上停下，再按一次才是使用。</li>', '<li>Item boxes come back quickly after you break them. Press item while the roulette spins to stop it, then press again to use it.</li>'),
    ('<li>金币：最多 10 枚，越多极速越高，被打中会掉 3 枚。</li>', '<li>Coins: hold up to 10. More coins = higher top speed. You drop 3 when hit.</li>'),
    ('<li>辅助选项（菜单里）：「智能转向」会在快冲出赛道时帮你拉回来；「自动道具」会替你找时机用道具。适合新手和小朋友。</li>',
     '<li>Assists (in the menu): “Smart steering” keeps you from driving off the track, and “Auto-item” uses items for you at a good moment. Great for beginners and kids.</li>'),
    ('<li>改装：比赛里吃到的金币加上名次奖励会累计起来，攒够就能在菜单「改装」里解锁新车身、轮胎和滑翔翼。每种零件都有得有失，电脑车手也从同一批零件里随机挑。进度和选择会自动存档。</li>',
     '<li>Garage: coins from races plus finishing bonuses add up and unlock new bodies, tires and gliders in the Garage. Every part has trade-offs, and CPU drivers pick from the same parts. Progress is saved automatically.</li>'),
    ('<li>比赛结束后点「🎬 最快圈回放」，可以用电影镜头回看你最快的一圈。</li>', '<li>After a race, press “🎬 Best lap replay” to watch your fastest lap with cinematic cameras.</li>'),
    ('<li>开出路面到草地或沙地会变慢；有些弯道外侧没有护栏，冲出去会掉下去，云朵会把你送回赛道（耽误两秒多）。开反方向屏幕上会提示「逆行！」。</li>',
     '<li>Grass and sand slow you down. Some corners have no barrier, and if you fall off a cloud carries you back (it costs about two seconds). Drive the wrong way and you will see “WRONG WAY!”.</li>'),
    ('<li>蓝色跳台是滑翔跳台：飞起来会自动展开滑翔翼，在空中能飞很远，还能转向。</li>', '<li>Blue ramps are glide ramps: your glider opens automatically and you can fly far and steer in the air.</li>'),
    ('<li>反重力路段（两边亮蓝色灯带）：车轮会翻成悬浮状态，这时和别的车相撞双方都会转圈加速。</li>', '<li>Anti-gravity sections (glowing blue edges): your wheels flip to hover mode, and bumping another kart spins you both up for a boost.</li>'),
    ('<li>经典赛道照真实赛场布景：摩纳哥的海港和隧道、新加坡的金沙酒店、拉斯维加斯的大球、斯帕的雨和红水弯落差……有几条还加了滑翔台和反重力路段。</li>',
     '<li>Classic circuits follow real-world layouts with scenery inspired by each venue: a harbour and tunnel, city skylines, rain and steep climbs. Some add glide ramps and anti-gravity sections.</li>'),
    ('<h3>道具</h3>', '<h3>Items</h3>'),
    ('<div>🍌 香蕉皮：丢在路上让人打滑</div><div>🟢 绿色弹壳：直线发射，会反弹</div>', '<div>🍌 Banana Peel: drop it to make karts spin out</div><div>🟢 Bounce Shell: fires straight and bounces off walls</div>'),
    ('<div>🔴 追踪红弹：自动追前面的车</div><div>🚀 加速火箭 / 三连火箭：瞬间加速</div>', '<div>🔴 Homing Shell: chases the kart ahead</div><div>🚀 Rocket / Triple Rocket: instant speed boost</div>'),
    ('<div>⭐ 无敌星：无敌又加速，撞飞别人</div><div>🪙 金币：直接加 2 枚金币</div>', '<div>⭐ Super Star: invincible and faster, knocks others away</div><div>🪙 Coins: gives you 2 coins</div>'),
    ('<div>🦑 墨鱼喷墨：糊住前面车手的屏幕</div><div>⚡ 缩小闪电：除你以外全体变小减速</div>', '<div>🦑 Squid Ink: splats the screens of karts ahead</div><div>⚡ Shrink Bolt: shrinks and slows everyone else</div>'),
    ('<div>🎯 追冠导弹：从天而降打第一名</div><div>📯 超级喇叭：震飞身边的车和道具，能炸掉追冠导弹</div>', '<div>🎯 Leader Missile: drops from the sky onto 1st place</div><div>📯 Shock Horn: blasts nearby karts and items away, even the Leader Missile</div>'),
