    ('<p>道具箱可以存两个道具：右上小圈是第二个，第一个用完自动补上。</p>', '<p>You can hold two items: the small circle top right is the second one and moves up when the first is used.</p>'),
    ('<h3>模式</h3>', '<h3>Modes</h3>'),
