    ('<td>大奖赛</td><td>星星杯（阳光草原、落日海湾、彩虹城市）、月亮杯（雪山小镇、熔岩火山、糖果乐园）或彩虹杯（沙漠神殿、海底遗迹、彩虹之路）连跑 3 场，按名次积分，最后颁奖。选哪条赛道就跑哪个杯</td>',
     '<td>Grand Prix</td><td>Race 3 courses in a row in the Star Cup, Moon Cup or Rainbow Cup, score points by position and finish on the podium. The course you pick decides the cup</td>'),
    ('<td>赛季</td><td>按真实赛历跑 24 站经典赛道（墨尔本、上海、铃鹿、巴林……阿布扎比），按 F1 规则积分 25-18-15-12-10-8-6-4-2-1，20 名车手 10 支车队，有车手榜和车队榜，每站自动存档，下次接着跑</td>',
     '<td>Season</td><td>A 24-round championship on classic circuits, scored 25-18-15-12-10-8-6-4-2-1, with 20 drivers in 10 teams, driver and team standings, and autosave after every round</td>'),
    ('<td>双人对战</td><td>两人上下分屏，和 10 名电脑对手一起跑</td>', '<td>2 Players</td><td>Split screen for two players plus 10 CPU drivers</td>'),
    ('<td>对战模式</td><td>霓虹竞技场里混战，四种玩法：<b>气球大战</b>（被打中少一个气球，掉光出局）、<b>抢金币</b>（2 分钟金币最多的赢，被打中会掉金币）、<b>抢夺闪光</b>（累计拿着闪光 20 秒就赢，被打中或被撞会掉）、<b>炸弹大战</b>（道具只有炸弹）</td>',
     '<td>Battle</td><td>A free-for-all in the Neon Arena with four games: <b>Balloon Battle</b> (lose a balloon when hit, out when they are gone), <b>Coin Rush</b> (most coins after 2 minutes wins, you drop coins when hit), <b>Gem Keeper</b> (hold the Gem for 20 seconds in total, you drop it when hit or bumped) and <b>Bomb Blast</b> (bombs only)</td>'),
    ('<td>自定义规则</td><td>单场比赛和双人对战可以改：道具（正常 / 疯狂 / 只有弹壳 / 只有香蕉 / 只有加速 / 无道具）、电脑水平、圈数、红蓝组队。组队时队友的道具打不到自己人，按名次积分算哪队赢</td>',
     '<td>Rules</td><td>For Race and 2 Players you can change items (normal / frantic / shells only / bananas only / boosts only / none), CPU level, laps and red vs. blue teams. Teammates cannot hit each other and the team with more points wins</td>'),
    ('<td>计时赛</td><td>一个人跑，开局给 3 个加速火箭。会记录最快圈并生成幽灵车陪你跑；每条赛道保存前 5 名总时间排行榜</td>',
     '<td>Time Trial</td><td>Race alone with 3 rockets. Your best lap is saved as a ghost to race against, and each course keeps a top-5 leaderboard</td>'),
    ('<td>公平规则</td><td>电脑和玩家完全同一套规则：没有偷偷追赶加速，起步、道具转盘时间都一样；拿到什么道具只看当前名次，谁落后都一样；发车位置随机，大奖赛第 2 场起积分最高的排最后。难度只影响电脑开得好不好</td>',
     '<td>Fair play</td><td>CPU drivers follow exactly the same rules as you: no hidden catch-up speed, the same start and item roulette, items depend only on position, random grid (from race 2 of a Grand Prix the points leader starts last). Difficulty only changes how well the CPU drives</td>'),
    ('<td>引擎</td><td>50cc 最慢最简单，200cc 最快；勾选「镜像模式」赛道左右翻转</td>', '<td>Class</td><td>50cc is the slowest and easiest, 200cc the fastest. “Mirror” flips the course left to right</td>'),
    ('id="helpClose" type="button">知道了</button>', 'id="helpClose" type="button">Got it</button>'),

